            "Handprints: %s | Ghost Orb: %s | EMF Level: %d\n\n" ..
            "--- GHOST IDENTITY ---\n" ..
            "Gender: %s | Age: %s\n" ..
            "Favorite Target Room: %s\n" ..
            "Status: %s",
            tostring(Diff), PhotosCount, tostring(CurrentR),
            LowestTemp, (LowestTempRoom and LowestTempRoom.Name or "None"),
            HandprintsCheck, GhostOrbCheck, EMFLevelCheck,
            tostring(GhostGender), tostring(GhostAge), tostring(GhostFavRoom),
            (GhostHunting and "⚠️ HUNTING ⚠️" or "Chilling")
